<title>NIGERIA: Nigerian Nestle Q1 profit down.</title>
<headline>Nigerian Nestle Q1 profit down.</headline>
<dateline>LAGOS 1997-07-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>First quarter result for Nestle Nigeria Plc to end-March 1997. (In million naira)</p>
<p>				1997	    1996</p>
<p>Turnover		    1,000	   1,300</p>
<p>Profit before Taxation    153.4	   169.9</p>
<p>Taxation			 52.2	    57.8</p>
<p> Profit after taxation    101.2	   112.1</p>
<p>($1=84.5)</p>
<p>-- Lagos newsroom +234 1 263 03 17</p>
</text>
